{"version":2,"width":100,"height":34,"timestamp":1793334197,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"scripts/demo.sh","title":"object store demo","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"},"theme":{"fg":"#e6e6e6","bg":"#212733","palette":"#35424b:#b45547:#6caa71:#c4ac62:#6d96b4:#bd7bcd:#7ccbce:#dee6ec:#465c6d:#e06c5a:#79be7e:#e5c872:#67b5ed:#d389e5:#84dee1:#e6eff6"}}
[1.792622, "o", "\u001b[1mobject store demo\u001b[0m: 1 coordinator (metadata in Postgres), 4 storage nodes.\r\n   \u001b[2mShipped settings: SUSPECT after 6s of silence, DEAD after 15s,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.792852, "o", "   \u001b[2mrepair grace 30s, a repair pass every 10s.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m── 1/6  Upload a file \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.895924, "o", "   osctl put: 40 MiB → split into 4 MiB chunks; each chunk is sent to 3 of the 4\r\n   nodes in parallel, verified and fsynced there, and committed once at least 2 confirm.\r\n"]
[2.696082, "o", "   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m uploaded in 0.8s\r\n"]
[2.850465, "o", "   chunk     node1   node2   node3   node4\r\n             ALIVE   ALIVE   ALIVE   ALIVE\r\n       0         H       .       H       H\r\n       1         H       H       .       H\r\n       2         H       H       H       .\r\n"]
[2.85047, "o", "       3         .       H       H       H\r\n       4         H       .       H       H\r\n       5         H       H       .       H\r\n       6         H       H       H       .\r\n"]
[2.850471, "o", "       7         .       H       H       H\r\n"]
[2.850477, "o", "       8         H       .       H       H\r\n       9         H       H       .       H\r\n"]
[2.85048, "o", "   H = replica from the upload, R = copied by repair, BAD = marked bad, . = none\r\n"]
[4.883474, "o", "   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m 30 replicas recorded, and every replica file verifies on its node's disk\r\n"]
[4.88349, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.883491, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m── 2/6  Stop a node \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.908978, "o", "   node1 holds 8 of the 10 chunks. Stopping it: it stops sending heartbeats\r\n   (every 2s), and the coordinator judges it by the silence alone.\r\n"]
[6.149028, "o", "      1.2s  node1 stopped\r\n"]
[10.134523, "o", "      5.2s  ALIVE → SUSPECT\r\n"]
[19.050107, "o", "     14.1s  SUSPECT → DEAD\r\n"]
[19.067116, "o", "   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m node1 went SUSPECT, then DEAD; uploads now skip it\r\n"]
[19.067123, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.067152, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m── 3/6  Re-replication \u001b[0m\r\n   node1's copies keep counting for 30s after it is DEAD: a node that is\r\n"]
[19.067157, "o", "   only rebooting shouldn't cause 8 chunks to be copied. Then they stop counting.\r\n"]
[19.080172, "o", "\r\u001b[K   grace: 30s left"]
[20.120402, "o", "\r\u001b[K   grace: 29s left"]
[21.162548, "o", "\r\u001b[K   grace: 28s left"]
